my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
ABCDEFGHIJ
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{5x deletes 5 characters},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: `5x` deletes 5 characters starting from under the cursor

Macro: `xt/visual/macros/count_delete_5x`

**initial.png** (before):
- Line 1: `ABCDEFGHIJ`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0 (on `A`)

Keys: `5x`

**after_5x.png** (after):
- Line 1: `FGHIJ` (`ABCDE` deleted)
- Cursor at line 1, col 0 (on `F`)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('5x');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_5x');
    },
}
